 "description": "Master how AI is reshaping HIM practice and how to govern it — clinical NLP, large language models, computer-assisted and autonomous coding, AI-driven CDI, ambient documentation, revenue cycle automation, RPA, data readiness, bias and equity, vendor evaluation, production monitoring, AI governance, the regulatory landscape, privacy and liability. The HIM professional’s guide to becoming the person who can answer whether the machine is right.",
 "lessons": 20,
